ioned microSD card is not included, and needs to be purchased separately. </p>\n        <p>11 The mentioned TPU protective case, tablet stand cover and Armor Mount Max are not included, and need to be purchased separately.</p>\n        <p>12. The product, accessories, and package may vary in different markets. Pictures are for reference only. Please refer to the actual products.</p>\n        <p>13. The data on the page are theoretical values from Ulefone lab based on specific test environment (see details at specific description). In actual use, there may be slight differences due to product differences, software versions, use conditions and environmental factors, so please refer to actual situation as final.</p> \n    </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"sec-block\" style=\"    margin-top: 40%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-1_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-2_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-3_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-4_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-5_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-6_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-7_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-ArmorPad4UltraThermal-M-8_240816.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Pr